			"notes": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v2.8.10 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### New Features\n* Make drums no longer require a Material by @TechLord22 in https://github.com/GregTechCEu/GregTech/pull/2527\n\n### Bug Fixes\n* Improvement to DT hatch logic by @M-W-K in https://github.com/GregTechCEu/GregTech/pull/2524\n* Fix the lighter behaviour by @MCTian-mi in https://github.com/GregTechCEu/GregTech/pull/2526\n* Fix EUt usage of HPCA with custom higher tier Components by @Synthitic in #2512\n* Fix Miner Pipe Deleting TileEntities by @ghzdude #2529 \n* Fix crash with Forestry integration by @TechLord22 in #2531\n\n### Translation Changes\n* Update ru_RU lang for 2.8.9 by @marisathewitch in https://github.com/GregTechCEu/GregTech/pull/2523\n* Update and Fix ja_jp.lang for 2.8.10 by @MrKono in https://github.com/GregTechCEu/GregTech/pull/2534\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/GregTechCEu/GregTech/compare/v2.8.9...v2.8.10"
